Z||000000||Banzai||09-04-2001||08:32 AM||||I was burning out the front cradle bushings when POP-----one of the bushings flew out and  hit my hand. Hot rubber on the fingers doesn't feel good. Just a warning to all who might have to do the same.<P>Banzai !!!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||NEPTUNE||09-04-2001||08:48 AM||||if you press them out, you don't run the risk of burning yourself, garage. also fire will destroy the anti rust coating. <BR>using fire for this is like shooting flies with a shotgun. it will work, but there is a better way. ||||reg||1
